WEBVTT

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:01.768
I'm trying to assert

00:20:01.792 --> 00:20:03.893
that my schedule
has been determined, right?

00:20:03.917 --> 00:20:05.184
You can take a look at it,

00:20:05.208 --> 00:20:08.726
and you can go and claim time on it,
if you want, on my terms.

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:11.434
And that feels like
a little bit of a power move.

00:20:11.458 --> 00:20:12.726
What do you think?

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.559
EP: On you, from you.
AG: Yeah, yeah.

00:20:14.583 --> 00:20:17.559
I'm basically saying,
"Look, I'm more important than you are."

00:20:17.583 --> 00:20:20.184
So here's my calendar,
pick what's convenient for you,

00:20:20.208 --> 00:20:22.809
but what's convenient for you
is already predetermined

00:20:22.833 --> 00:20:24.226
by what's convenient for me,

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:28.393
which is why I hate when someone sends me
a calendar link and says, "Sign up on it."

00:20:28.417 --> 00:20:29.684
EP: Because?

00:20:29.708 --> 00:20:31.184
AG: Because I feel like --